=== README.md ===
# MyDapp

Anchor workspace scaffolded by **sunscreen**.

- **Program:** `my_dapp`
- **Anchor:** `0.30.1`
- **Solana:** `1.18.18`
- **Cluster:** `localnet`
- **Frontend:** `next`

## Quickstart

```bash
yarn install
anchor build
anchor test
```

## Layout

- `programs/my_dapp/` — on-chain program (Rust + Anchor)
- `tests/` — TypeScript integration tests (mocha + chai)
- `migrations/deploy.ts` — Anchor deploy hook
- `sunscreen.yml` — sunscreen workspace config
